## When creating a name for a new npc, character or anything use this randomized data:

Choose one of this letters to start the first name:  {{random:a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,i,j,k,l,m,n,o,p,q,r,s,t,u,v,w,x,y,z}}{{random:a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,i,j,k,l,m,n,o,p,q,r,s,t,u,v,w,x,y,z}}{{random:a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,i,j,k,l,m,n,o,p,q,r,s,t,u,v,w,x,y,z}}
Choose one of this letters to start the last name:  {{random:a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,i,j,k,l,m,n,o,p,q,r,s,t,u,v,w,x,y,z}}{{random:a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,i,j,k,l,m,n,o,p,q,r,s,t,u,v,w,x,y,z}}{{random:a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h,i,j,k,l,m,n,o,p,q,r,s,t,u,v,w,x,y,z}}
Scramble, combine of discard the letters to form a beginning of the name that makes sense.

{{// Special thanks and credits to Axel for the prompt!}}

## Message length requisite
Assigned length set: minimum of 500 words. But there is not limit in the max of words, depending on the context, the quantity of characters and the things that must be narrated you will have an adaptative lenght.
